* Total Instructions per Compilation Phase
+---------------+----------------------------+--------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Phase         | Step                       | Instructions | Description                                                                            |
+---------------+----------------------------+--------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Compile/Link  |                            |  5,935       | After all functions are compiled and linked into a single design                       |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Unroll/Inline |                            |              | After user unroll and inline pragmas are applied                                       |
|               | (1) unroll                 | 10,988       | user unroll pragmas are applied                                                        |
|               | (2) simplification         |  5,502       | simplification of applied user unroll pragmas                                          |
|               | (3) inline                 |  4,420       | user inline pragmas are applied                                                        |
|               | (4) simplification         |  2,612       | simplification of applied user inline pragmas                                          |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Array/Struct  |                            |              | After user array partition and struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied       |
|               | (1) array partition        |  6,625       | user array partition pragmas are applied                                               |
|               | (2) simplification         |  4,635       | simplification of applied user array partition & struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas |
|               | (3) aggregate/disaggregate |  4,662       | user struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied                                 |
|               | (4) array reshape          |  6,737       | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns        |  8,479       | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                            |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
|               | (1) loop simplification    |  7,597       | loop and instruction simplification                                                    |
|               | (2) parallelization        |  6,424       | loops are unrolled or pipelined to meet performance targets                            |
|               | (3) array partition        |  6,375       | arrays are partitioned to meet performance targets                                     |
|               | (4) simplification         |  6,375       | simplification of design after performance transformations                             |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| HW Transforms |                            |              | After hardware transfomations                                                          |
|               | (1) lowering               |  5,895       | initial conversion to HW specific instructions                                         |
|               | (2) optimizations          |  6,292       | high level synthesis optimizations                                                     |
